    'One occasion drawn. Fortune reports on Nov 12 that a senator "has already sought answers from Nvidia about Supermicro and chip smuggling in June and she re-upped her request this week". The take-in had left it as not to be settled, for want of a day; it is on her chip of Nov 12 now, dated by its report. It cuts against Nvidia.',
